      "type": "text",
      "text": "Dry eyes: preservative-free drops (initially hypromellose or methylcellulose) + an OTC ointment at bedtime; also topical cyclosporine, occasionally topical corticosteroids (ophthalmology)"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
