    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Severe extraglandular dz (eg, cryoglobulinemic vasculitis, neuropathy, severe lung involvement, refractory arthritis): corticosteroids (eg, oral prednisone 1 mg/kg once a day) or rituximab"
     }
